{
  "info": {
    "name": "Purificadora Colibrí — Pedidos",
    "description": "# Purificadora Colibrí — API de pedidos\n\n**Base:** `{{baseUrl}}` → `http://localhost:8000/api`\n\n## ApiResponse\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"SUCCESS\", \"code\": 200, \"message\": \"...\", \"data\": {}, \"errors\": null }\n```\n\n## Estados (`estado`)\n| valor | significado |\n|-------|-------------|\n| 0 | pendiente |\n| 1 | en proceso |\n| 2 | completado |\n| 3 | cancelado |\n| 4 | eliminado (soft; no aparece en index) |\n\n## Montos (camelCase en JSON)\n- `cantidadGarrafones` (default store: 1)\n- `precioUnitario` (default store: 25)\n- `total` — **solo lectura**; lo calcula el API (cantidad × precio) en store y actualizar\n\n## Auth\n| Endpoint | Token |\n|----------|-------|\n| POST store | No |\n| Resto | Bearer Sanctum |\n\n## Login prueba\n- POST `/auth/login` → `{ \"email\": \"6682485970\", \"password\": \"123456\" }`\n- Rol: `ventas_purificadora_colibri`\n\n## Flujo sugerido\n1. Login → `token`\n2. Store (público) → `pedidoId`, `whatsappUrl`\n3. GET marcar en proceso (Bearer)\n4. PUT actualizar (opcional)\n5. PUT completado / cancelado / eliminado\n\n## Fechas\nISO 8601 con zona (`createdAt`, `pendienteFecha`, etc.).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pedidoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "whatsappUrl", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Purificadora Colibrí)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.data && j.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.data.token);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"6682485970\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Público",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear pedido (store)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.data) {",
                  "    const p = j.data.pedido;",
                  "    if (p && p.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('pedidoId', String(p.id));",
                  "    if (j.data.whatsapp_url) pm.collectionVariables.set('whatsappUrl', j.data.whatsapp_url);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"María López\",\n  \"celular\": \"6671234567\",\n  \"correo\": \"maria@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"calle\": \"Blvd. Centenario\",\n  \"numero\": \"1234\",\n  \"colonia\": \"Centro\",\n  \"codigoPostal\": \"81200\",\n  \"municipio\": \"Ahome\",\n  \"cantidadGarrafones\": 2,\n  \"precioUnitario\": 25\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos",
            "description": "POST /api/purificadora-pedidos\n\n**201 data:**\n- `pedido`: PurificadoraPedidoResource (`total` = cantidad × precio)\n- `whatsapp_url`: GET marcar en proceso (requiere Bearer al llamar)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Protegido (Sanctum)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar pedidos (index)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos?estado=0&sort_by=created_at&order=desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["purificadora-pedidos"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "nombre", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "celular", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "estado", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "creacion_desde", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "creacion_hasta", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "actualizacion_desde", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "actualizacion_hasta", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "estado_fecha_desde", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "estado_fecha_hasta", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "sort_by", "value": "created_at" },
                { "key": "order", "value": "desc" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar pedido",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"María López\",\n  \"celular\": \"6671234567\",\n  \"correo\": \"maria@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"calle\": \"Blvd. Centenario\",\n  \"numero\": \"1234\",\n  \"colonia\": \"Centro\",\n  \"codigoPostal\": \"81200\",\n  \"municipio\": \"Ahome\",\n  \"cantidadGarrafones\": 3,\n  \"precioUnitario\": 25\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos/{{pedidoId}}/actualizar",
            "description": "PUT /api/purificadora-pedidos/{id}/actualizar\n\nCampos en camelCase (parcial o completo). No cambia `estado` ni fechas de flujo.\nSi cambian cantidad o precio, el API recalcula `total`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Marcar en proceso (whatsappUrl)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{whatsappUrl}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Marcar en proceso (por id)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos/{{pedidoId}}/marcar-pedido-proceso-whatsapp-enlace"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Completado",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos/{{pedidoId}}/completado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelado",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos/{{pedidoId}}/cancelado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminado (soft)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/purificadora-pedidos/{{pedidoId}}/eliminado",
            "description": "PUT /api/purificadora-pedidos/{id}/eliminado → estado 4"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
